 testMergedTypes;r;req;db;con;result;cols;data;types
⍝ Test merged type coverage: DECIMAL, BLOB, BIT, HUGEINT, INTERVAL, ARRAY
:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf
req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test Merged Types'

db←open':memory:'
con←connect db

⍝ ===== DECIMAL =====
result←query con'SELECT 1.23::DECIMAL(5,2) AS d1, 123456789.0123456789::DECIMAL(18,10) AS d2'
:If 3=≢result
    data←1⊃result
    r,←⊂'DECIMAL(5,2) value'req 1.23=⊃⊃data
    r,←⊂'DECIMAL(18,10) value'req 1E¯8>|123456789.0123456789-⊃1⊃data
:Else
    r,←⊂'DECIMAL query'req 0
:EndIf

⍝ ===== BLOB =====
result←query con'SELECT ''\x00\x01\xFF''::BLOB AS b'
:If 3=≢result
    data←1⊃result
    r,←⊂'BLOB returns byte vector'req 3=≢⊃⊃data
    r,←⊂'BLOB first byte'req 0=⊃⊃⊃data
    r,←⊂'BLOB last byte'req ¯1≡¯1↑⊃⊃data  ⍝ 0xFF as signed I1 = ¯1
:Else
    r,←⊂'BLOB query'req 0
:EndIf

⍝ ===== BIT =====
result←query con'SELECT ''10110''::BIT AS b'
:If 3=≢result
    data←1⊃result
    r,←⊂'BIT returns boolean vector'req(1 0 1 1 0)≡⊃⊃data
:Else
    r,←⊂'BIT query'req 0
:EndIf

⍝ ===== HUGEINT =====
result←query con'SELECT 170141183460469231731687303715884105727::HUGEINT AS h'
:If 3=≢result
    data←1⊃result
    r,←⊂'HUGEINT value'req 0≠⊃⊃data  ⍝ just check non-zero (exact match depends on float precision)
:Else
    r,←⊂'HUGEINT query'req 0
:EndIf

⍝ ===== INTERVAL =====
result←query con'SELECT INTERVAL ''1 year 2 months 3 days 4 hours 5 minutes 6 seconds'' AS iv'
:If 3=≢result
    data←1⊃result
    r,←⊂'INTERVAL months'req 14=⊃⊃⊃data     ⍝ 1 year + 2 months = 14
    r,←⊂'INTERVAL days'req 3=1⊃⊃⊃data
    r,←⊂'INTERVAL hours'req 4=2⊃⊃⊃data
    r,←⊂'INTERVAL minutes'req 5=3⊃⊃⊃data
    r,←⊂'INTERVAL seconds'req 6=4⊃⊃⊃data
:Else
    r,←⊂'INTERVAL query'req 0
:EndIf

⍝ ===== ARRAY =====
result←query con'SELECT [1,2,3]::INT[3] AS a'
:If 3=≢result
    data←1⊃result
    r,←⊂'ARRAY value'req(1 2 3)≡⊃⊃data
:Else
    r,←⊂'ARRAY query'req 0
:EndIf

⍝ ===== NULL handling in new types =====
result←query con'SELECT NULL::DECIMAL(5,2) AS d, NULL::BLOB AS b'
:If 3=≢result
    data←1⊃result
    r,←⊂'NULL DECIMAL'req null≡⊃⊃data
    r,←⊂'NULL BLOB'req null≡⊃1⊃data
:Else
    r,←⊂'NULL new types query'req 0
:EndIf

disconnect con
close db
⎕←↑r

⍝ KSL 2.0.1
